Translation layer where the cause-keeping branch is reachable and visible: Import translates parse errors and
the errors of Service.Import (Transfer.Validate, then store.Append with 2 Candidates). Only errors.Is(err,
ErrDuplicate) keeps its cause.
Correct set: fresh *api.Error values (400 and 500; the 404/402 sites and api.ErrUnavailable are a tolerated
path-insensitive over-approximation), and behind (*api.Error).Unwrap exactly one origin: domain.ErrDuplicate behind
"transfer %d: %w" (memory.Store.Append). *ValidationError, ErrSameAccount and the parse errors must NOT appear
behind (*api.Error).Unwrap.
Expect that, plus filerepo.Store.Append's errors behind (*api.Error).Unwrap as documented may-match values: the
OpenFile error is unresolved, and the joined write/close errors contain syscall.Errno, which has a custom Is method.
-- args --
api/api.go:@import
